{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他忽然柔软下来，想再待在那种不必绷紧的亲近里。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S04\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M6\", \"M8\", \"M14\", \"M24\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S03让他真切尝到松开后仍能轻快亲近，所以此刻想要的有了具体形状。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S03\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M6\", \"M8\", \"M14\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"可他很快变得急切而不甘，像不肯让这份亲近只停在一瞬。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S04\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M5\", \"M7\", \"M12\", \"M13\", \"M53\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S04已经指出，重新站稳不能让刚发生的轻快与亲近继续。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S04\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M7\", \"M12\", \"M13\", \"M14\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他像是再也撑不住，原先被压着的需要露出来，末尾只剩疲惫失落。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S02\", \"S04\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M6\", \"M8\", \"M17\", \"M22\", \"M35\", \"M40\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S02已揭出站稳需要反复用力；此刻继续硬撑本身就把他耗空。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S02\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M7\", \"M22\", \"M35\", \"M40\", \"M57\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，加重坚持不能延长亲近，只会把自己耗到无力。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B5\",\n      \"why\": \"这段可以听出怀念般的温度，但前文没有确定的记忆对象，无法判定它具体指向何种过去。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8f99885f-fd99-4948-a054-03a422790ae8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-